---
/**
 * Home hero section — ported from reference/home-mockup-reference.html.
 */
---

<section class="hero">
  <div>
    <p class="hero-eyebrow">rock desde costa rica</p>
    <h1>tocamos donde <em>otros no tocarían.</em></h1>
    <p class="hero-copy">
      Esta es nuestra gira: sin escenarios fijos, sin fechas oficiales.
      Grabamos donde el país nos lleva — ríos, montañas, calles. Y la
      entrada es gratis si andás cerca.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a class="btn btn-solid" href="/lado-a-lado-b">escuchar lado a</a>
      <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/las-cintas">ver las cintas</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-visual">
    <p class="label">
      [ espacio para foto o video de portada — una sesión real en un
      lugar de cr ]
    </p>
    <div class="play-hint">
      <span class="dot"></span>
      <span>grabado en Manuel Antonio</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    max-width: 68.75rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 3.5rem 1rem 2.5rem;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 1fr;
    gap: 3rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  @media (max-width: 50rem) {
    .hero {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      padding-top: 2rem;
    }
  }

  .hero-eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--stereo-blue);
    margin-bottom: 0.875rem;
  }

  .hero h1 {
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 5vw, 2.75rem);
    line-height: 1.12;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .hero h1 em {
    font-style: normal;
    color: var(--view-master);
  }

  .hero-copy {
    font-size: 1rem;
    opacity: 0.85;
    max-width: 27.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.875rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .btn {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    text-transform: lowercase;
    padding: 0.8125rem 1.625rem;
    display: inline-block;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  .btn-solid {
    background: var(--brown-tape);
    color: var(--vintage-sky);
    border: 2px solid var(--brown-tape);
  }
  .btn-solid:hover {
    background: var(--view-master);
    border-color: var(--view-master);
  }

  .btn-outline {
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--brown-tape);
    border: 2px solid var(--brown-tape);
  }
  .btn-outline:hover {
    background: var(--brown-tape);
    color: var(--vintage-sky);
  }

  .hero-visual {
    position: relative;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
    border-radius: 4px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 30% 20%, rgba(239, 154, 73, 0.5), transparent 55%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 75% 70%, rgba(213, 72, 82, 0.45), transparent 55%),
      linear-gradient(160deg, #3d241f, var(--brown-tape));
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .hero-visual .label {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--vintage-sky);
    opacity: 0.7;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 0 1.5rem;
  }

  .play-hint {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 1.125rem;
    left: 1.125rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
    padding: 0.5rem 0.875rem;
    border-radius: 1.875rem;
  }

  .play-hint .dot {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--view-master);
  }

  .play-hint span:last-child {
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    color: var(--vintage-sky);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
</style>
